  "en": {
    "id": 8015040,
    "name": "Lord of Saṃvartasthāyi, Asat Pramad: \"Existence\"",
    "desc": "A Navigator named \"Isee\" embarked on a trailblazing expedition to save the Elation.\\nHe helped planets overcome crises, resolving troubles across the cosmos, all to find a cure for the Elation.\\nYet, the longer his journey went on, the more familiar worlds he witnessed descending into corruption and ruin. One world even attempted to repay the Express Crew's rescue with mutual destruction.\\nUltimately, after the fall of the God of Trailblaze and having witnessed the end of Adlivun with his own eyes, he finally realized that the only cure for the Elation was... the Destruction.",
